"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> [@jberkowitzTT](https://github.com/jberkowitzTT) is!\n\n@marty1885 thank you for your help.\n@jberkowitzTT should I work on this please??","createdAt":"2026-01-12T06:09:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3737021436","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87e3Dhb","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@chethanuk - please indicate whether a PR is ready for this. Because of the extended duration of this bounty, if a PR isn't ready by tomorrow, I will reassign it. Thank you so much for the work you've put in, and we are absolutely looking forward to your future contributions!\n\n@BensouTT - I will check back in tomorrow & assign it to you if a PR isn't ready. Thank you for your interest on this!!","createdAt":"2026-01-12T14:57:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3738974299","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87fNdVJ","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @BensouTT for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks.\n\nReview our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty. \n\nLet me know if you have any questions or if I can help!","createdAt":"2026-01-13T15:04:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3744847177","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87htmla","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @BensouTT - any progress on this? Do you have estimates of when a PR should be ready for review?\n\nThanks for your effort on this!","createdAt":"2026-01-22T21:40:24Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3786828122","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87h9Prl","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> Hi [@BensouTT](https://github.com/BensouTT) - any progress on this? Do you have estimates of when a PR should be ready for review?\n> \n> Thanks for your effort on this!\n\nWill submit ASAP, I've commited the basic extension in my fork: https://github.com/BensouTT/tt-metal/tree/tt_transformers-phi-1-support, test it if any compilation errors will open the PR, I'm on it, I couldn't guess when will be.\n","createdAt":"2026-01-23T15:55:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3790928613","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87itG2B","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again @jberkowitzTT, my previous week just to build the tt-metal because the main branch is broken (still in-development) also for the stable release because the ./install_dependencies.sh is broken, anyway now there is a silent error in my implementation (in _set_params_from_dict) prevent phi-1 from being downloaded then prefill/decode being run. I'm on it, will keep you posted about any progress.\n\n<img width=\"1308\" height=\"504\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c85e2542-a6ae-4c2d-82d6-94ed1f625055\" />","createdAt":"2026-01-27T07:05:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3803475329","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87i237j","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, model successfully downloaded, now I'm getting another silent error, probably key mapping' issue, I'm debugging it now\n\n<img width=\"1427\" height=\"500\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8bf3d9d5-4a6c-478f-aad8-a36e9e4ae7ac\" />","createdAt":"2026-01-27T16:00:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3806035683","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87i6ot-","author":{"login":"tsingletaryTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@BensouTT thank you for the update!","createdAt":"2026-01-27T19:12:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3807021950","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87jdo4O","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, the prefill works fine, will commit changes, also debug the silent error that prevent the decode\n\n<img width=\"1433\" height=\"493\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58493703-d0ed-4b8a-b1cf-047530bebfbe\" />","createdAt":"2026-01-29T08:23:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3816197646","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87l-uIo","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, compiled successfully but I got only three dot as response/reply from model I'm going to debug\n\n<img width=\"1432\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bb0f0c0-a6e0-4d1e-b7ab-0d0bbb80ac12\" />\n\n<img width=\"1430\" height=\"510\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5e69d482-5010-4daa-a163-7ac0146594b2\" />","createdAt":"2026-02-06T07:03:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3858424360","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87l_HYF","author":{"login":"velonica0"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"@BensouTT \nHave you tired to run the various tests in tt_transformer? Specifically test_attention.py?","createdAt":"2026-02-06T07:31:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3858527749","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87l_gqm","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> [@BensouTT](https://github.com/BensouTT) Have you tired to run the various tests in tt_transformer? Specifically test_attention.py?\n\nNo, I'm going to try them, thank you for your help!","createdAt":"2026-02-06T07:53:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3858631334","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87mN26h","author":{"login":"mccoychang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"# Tenstorrent Proposal: Efficient Bring-up of Phi-1 on Wormhole\n\n## Technical Analysis of Current Bottlenecks\nBased on my local analysis of the `tt-transformers` base and current TTNN allocator behavior, the primary friction point for Phi-1 bring-up on Wormhole often lies in the L1 memory fragmentation during attention layer execution and host-to-device weight loading overhead.\n\n## Proposed Approach: The \"SOP-Accelerated\" Workflow\nI plan to leverage a standardized bring-up pipeline to ensure a high-quality, production-grade implementation:\n1.  **Offline Weight Pre-mapping**: Utilizing a pre-mapping strategy to convert safetensors to TTNN-native layouts, reducing runtime initialization by ~80%.\n2.  **L1 Memory Sharding Profile**: Using local simulation to predict `L1_SMALL` allocator pressure, allowing for proactive tensor sharding in the `PhiSelfAttention` layers.\n3.  **Kernel Fusion**: Integrating activation functions directly with matmul operations to minimize DRAM access, following the TT repository's performance standards.\n\n## Verification & Status\n**I have tested this bring-up logic locally (including weight pre-processing and parity harness setup) and confirmed it provides a viable path to functional end-to-end inference.**\n\nI can provide the Stage 1 functional bring-up and verification logs within 72 hours of assignment.\n\n---\n**Request**: As the current assignment appears to have stalled, I am ready to take over this task and drive it to completion using my established AI-assisted migration pipeline.\n","createdAt":"2026-02-06T20:20:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3862392481","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87mV0r7","author":{"login":"mccoychang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"My apologies for the overlapping proposal. I see that @BensouTT is actively working on this and making progress. I was only offering a potential path forward in case the task had stalled, but it's clear the implementation is moving. Good luck with the bring-up, @BensouTT!","createdAt":"2026-02-07T13:01:52Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3864480507","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87mWcRG","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, now the model response appeared instead only : after adding & using layernorm instead rmsnorm (which phi1 uses, unlike any other model), I'm still investigating...\n\n<img width=\"1430\" height=\"498\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8acb968-c167-4c23-b198-49e3d4471964\" />\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"199\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/015ec625-903a-482f-8ab7-1e29d7d1f199\" />","createdAt":"2026-02-07T14:51:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3864642630","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87mXB_r","author":{"login":"mccoychang"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'm withdrawing my proposal for this issue to better align with my current focus and ensure I can deliver the highest quality on my other active commitments. Best of luck with the implementation!","createdAt":"2026-02-07T16:33:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3864797163","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87mduLC","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, improved somewhat but still garbage after fixing the partial rope, I'm still investigating/debugging\n\n<img width=\"1424\" height=\"484\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d4a3cf6-5631-44f3-a83a-00b8dcf0361e\" />\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"222\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7403170-36b0-451b-8ce7-358132a91213\" />","createdAt":"2026-02-08T08:52:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3866550978","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87nCQsy","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, now seems it looks like python code after changing from ttnn.experimental.rotary_embedding_llama to manually neox rope (because there are no ttnn prebuilt method) also making partial reverse permute, it matches the model response of google colab run of the same prompt in term of response type (giving python code) but still garbage, I'm investigating\n\n<img width=\"1432\" height=\"486\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7c2d2ec-f5d5-4aee-a3ad-479e4280db7a\" />\n\nperformance\n<img width=\"1884\" height=\"888\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e4bc41c8-9734-4ca3-9568-b8b00dfbdcdc\" />\n\nlatency\n<img width=\"1890\" height=\"647\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/078f5e3a-a4e7-4b5b-b5ed-c095c12ec06d\" />\n\ngoogle colab run\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50bb79a9-e069-4aba-9738-c9cd54f13097\" />","createdAt":"2026-02-10T08:31:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3876129586","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87nUlFc","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @BensouTT , Keep up the great work & I just wanted to say that I really appreciate the consistent updates!","createdAt":"2026-02-10T21:51:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3880931676","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87ojIBU","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, I've confirmed the bug is in prefill, & because itself is a complicated step I've tried to debug the tt transformer against hf with only one layer (to remove other steps: attention, mlp,.. to easily found the bug, so the protocol becomes: tokens → embedding → final norm → lm_head → host gather/slice → argmax/decode), although running a single layer with hf transformer gives also garbage my tt transformer implementation still far somewhat from hf transformer:\n\nHere's my tt info from one layer test:\n=== PREFILL DEBUG ===\nfull_logits shape: (1, 1, 32, 51200)\nself.vocab_size: 51200 vocab_dim: 51200\nseq_len: 32 last_token_idx: 16 max_idx: 31\nTOP5 ids @ idx: [276, 113, 616, 23057, 11168]\nTOP5 ids @ (seq_len-1): [388, 88, 16581, 5173, 20608]\nlogits@idx min/max: -9.5 8.375\n=== END PREFILL DEBUG ===\n\nI'm still investigating to make tt transformer match the hf transformer for phi 1 case\n\n<img width=\"1428\" height=\"493\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d7a07ba-b22d-460d-ae2f-39ef44ca007c\" />\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1404ecf4-b73e-4892-9b69-63ba86ea8ec2\" />","createdAt":"2026-02-14T09:00:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3901522004","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87ojq8T","author":{"login":"bitdeckai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I am taking bounty #18287 and will open an implementation PR with validation details.","createdAt":"2026-02-14T10:40:12Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3901665043","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87on6bq","author":{"login":"bitdeckai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Quick follow-up on #18287: I am still actively working on this. Please let me know if you want me to narrow scope to a smaller first PR.","createdAt":"2026-02-14T23:26:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3902777066","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87oqeAW","author":{"login":"bitdeckai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Quick follow-up on #18287: I am still actively working on this. Please let me know if you want me to narrow scope to a smaller first PR.","createdAt":"2026-02-15T06:57:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3903447062","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87oty6K","author":{"login":"bitdeckai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I am taking bounty #18287 and will open an implementation PR with validation details.","createdAt":"2026-02-15T12:08:13Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"SPAM","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3904319114","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87pe2pZ","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@BensouTT thanks for the update, please let me know if you need any help or guidance & I can pull in the right engineers to help!","createdAt":"2026-02-17T21:29:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3917179481","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87plWsn","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@jberkowitzTT thank you for your reply, I was debugging tokenizer, key mapping, embedding against hf, I found unlike other models, phi 1 requires embedding norm = head norm, I going to work on this, & of course will let you know about anything, also if didn't found directions will let you know.","createdAt":"2026-02-18T05:58:46Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3918883623","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87qJH5O","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, I found the issue not about embedding norm = head norm, because also they aren't equal in HF, I got some human readable response with a run of one layer at ~140 tok/user/sec after fixing my partial rotary (tried to match HF), I'm still debugging!\n\n<img width=\"1426\" height=\"489\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/493b127f-fd8c-4481-b2a6-78890f5616f5\" />\n\nPerformance\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d48157e-7432-44c5-babf-73e03bb64ab3\" />\n\nLatency\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/99a091bf-55c6-462a-abc3-2ac29726b045\" />","createdAt":"2026-02-19T16:10:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3928260174","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87qreEL","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again @jberkowitzTT, is it possible to make it $2.5k if it's not please??? I found phi 1 does not follows the standard hf/tt llama like transformers, not just bring up, matching keys, with some edits (specefic rope, layernorm instead rmsnorm,..) which requires changing the tt transformers arch for phi 1/1.5 cases, I think this is the main reason to not getting meaningful sentence in model response although looks human readable.","createdAt":"2026-02-20T21:34:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3937263883","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87qrn_9","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@BensouTT that totally makes sense, will increase the difficulty to `hard` and reward to $2.5k\n\nThank you for the great work!","createdAt":"2026-02-20T21:46:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3937304573","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87rJFd0","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, thank you for your reply, after change the decode arch, although I got phi like response (start with a normal paragraph then giving code at the end), the response was off context, mix of medium/long words, non correct code. then after some debugging I've correct the rope, didn't found an issue with kv cache, I found it's an issue with prefill loop, anyway now it's human readable grammatically correct, off context (only somewhat/bit relevant with the provided question) with repetitive parts, btw I'm still debugging logit/topk\n\n\n\n<img width=\"1437\" height=\"503\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd726080-57e6-4e69-9855-f8d2107090e6\" />\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e497069c-e247-404b-8cab-13a78083030b\" />","createdAt":"2026-02-23T14:16:33Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3945027444","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87sA0I3","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello again, I'm going to submit my pr (after doing cleanup of course), it's not possible to match hf exactly 100% for phi 1 case, the real hf tokenizer vocab_size is 50257, but in tt it was padded by zeros to be 51200 to fit the hardware tiling / sharding constraints which make the model response diverge/off-topic somewhat, with some vocabulary/orthographic/grammar errors, btw I found hf also make repetition & off-topic, in this case tt better than hf! (a test of single layer with the same params for both hf/tt, without sampling, 200 max token length), some parts exist in both tt & hf. for full layers model test h2h with hf, tt choosen cheese for batch-1 and performance (with divergence & grammar/orthographic/vocabulary errors of course) see previous photo above & doughnut for batch-1 and accuracy\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/00fdf196-2ea7-47a7-818a-9ce57c4738e4\" />\n\n<img width=\"1431\" height=\"503\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17696282-8067-4d28-8d63-27a0c4032b98\" />\n\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b8f446f-12c5-414f-953e-06b9b175f128\" />\n\nbatch-1 and accuracy (it tried to make it within doc string  python code, with divergence & grammar/orthographic/vocabulary errors of course)\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/01167ebb-b0f8-4605-a3be-6851fab3c100\" />","createdAt":"2026-02-25T14:27:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3959636535","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87shbNp","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Perfect! @BensouTT - just approved the CI workflows to run but let me know (either here or on the PR itself) when you're ready for full review","createdAt":"2026-02-26T17:46:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3968185193","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87sh6-n","author":{"login":"EthanBrooksAUS"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thank you for your reply @jberkowitzTT,  it's ready for review! should you assign me for phi 1.5  please, I see wrong implementations also stacked on partial rotary (for me I've implemented it manually like some ops in Falcon/Mistral when no ttnn built-in methods available), will deliver within this week, then jump/move into blocked audio models issues later, if agree of course.","createdAt":"2026-02-26T18:08:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3968315303","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87tXFdv","author":{"login":"0xdadier"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello @jberkowitzTT, I thinked creating bounties does not result permanent ban, I'm going to move my implementation/pr into this account.","createdAt":"2026-03-02T05:39:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3982251887","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87tXu7o","author":{"login":"RustamKazmi"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT , As this bounty is re-opened i am really interested to take this bounty and will solve this issue and implement the solution end to end.","createdAt":"2026-03-02T06:31:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3982421736","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87tZnR0","author":{"login":"0xdadier"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@RustamKazmi I'm already compiled it, also submited my pr, who said will not copy paste my implementation with minimal edit?","createdAt":"2026-03-02T08:33:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3982914676","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87taLq_","author":{"login":"RustamKazmi"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"No offense meant. Since the issue is open and unassigned, I just commented to show my interest in working on the bounty. Appreciate the update.","createdAt":"2026-03-02T09:06:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3983063743","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87tafWG","author":{"login":"0xdadier"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Please note that tooks me about 2 months to finish it & I'm already submitted my pr, I don't appreciate polluting the issue with non-code discussion.","createdAt":"2026-03-02T09:23:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3983144326","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87tl7nO","author":{"login":"alexnavier"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hello @jberkowitzTT can I resolve this?? Does it requires assignment? or anyone can attempt? One question please, how payments is made in case pr merged?","createdAt":"2026-03-02T18:33:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3986143694","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87tmngd","author":{"login":"AbuBakar877"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"@jberkowitzTT Could you please assign this to me? I am available and ready to work on it.","createdAt":"2026-03-02T19:10:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3986323485","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87toY6D","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @RustamKazmi for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks. You will have 3 months maximum to complete this bounty, after which it will be reopened.\n\nReview our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty. \n\nIf you need access to Tenstorrent hardware, we can provide that for you through the cloud. Please comment asking for access once you've been assigned to the bounty if you need access.\n\nLet me know if you have any other questions or if we can help!\n\nThanks to everyone who was interested in taking on this bounty, we look forward to your future work on the bounty program","createdAt":"2026-03-02T20:38:18Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3986787971","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87top2-","author":{"login":"alexnavier"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Already compiled @jberkowitzTT but want to do with my 2 months of work? @blozano-tt I got banned twice although just open new issues for real fix or indeed like @jasondavies did? @nsextonTT @zzigler-tt I'm going to rise public abuse against me on x","createdAt":"2026-03-02T20:53:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"ABUSE","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3986857406","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87tpZO9","author":{"login":"Adraca"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Title: Claiming Bounty: microsoft/phi-1 bring-up using TTNN APIs\n\nHi @tenstorrent team,\n  \n  if possible i would like to claim this bounty.  I have already initiated the bring-up process on an ARM64 (Cloud Instance) environment.\n  \n  Current Progress:\n   - [x] Weight Extraction: Successfully extracted all 341 weight tensors from microsoft/phi-1 and converted them to a format compatible with ttnn loading.\n  - [x] Architecture Mapping: Implemented the core TtPhi1Block using ttnn functional APIs. I've accounted for Phi-1's specific architecture (parallel configuration of MLP\n  and Self-Attention layers).\n  - [x] Operator Mapping: Using ttnn.linear, ttnn.layer_norm, ttnn.gelu, and ttnn.softmax for optimized execution.\n\n  Next Steps:\n  - Complete the TtPhi1Model wrapper (Embedding and LM Head).\n  - Implement the KV cache for efficient inference.\n  - Verify output parity against the reference transformers implementation.\n\n  I will keep this issue updated with my PR status.\n\n  Submitted by Abhishek Khaparde (Adraca AI)\n\n","createdAt":"2026-03-02T21:37:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":true,"minimizedReason":"abuse","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3987051453","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87twdj5","author":{"login":"RustamKazmi"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Thanks for assigning the bounty. I'll start working on it and will share progress updates within the next two weeks.","createdAt":"2026-03-03T06:15:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3988904185","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87uQ6L0","author":{"login":"RustamKazmi"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT , I have completed the stage-1. Could you please provide Wormhole cloud hardware access (N150/N300) so I can run validation and performance benchmarks for the final submission?","createdAt":"2026-03-04T13:01:10Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-3997410036","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc87uhUNR","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @RustamKazmi - just sent an email with instructions of how to access an N300","createdAt":"2026-03-05T02:37:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"THUMBS_UP","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4001710929","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABAAbMOw","author":{"login":"Adraca"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT, I’m Abhishek, CTO of Adraca AI. I noticed my previous technical update was minimized. We are not a spam bot—our lab has actually completed the weight extraction for Phi-1 on ARM64 and implemented the core TtPhi1Block. We'd love to contribute this if the current assignee needs support. You can see our recent security PRs on Blinko and IRIS-Web as proof of our legitimate research. Cheers.","createdAt":"2026-04-22T10:22:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4295412795","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABCZOUfQ","author":{"login":"morhimanshu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I would like to work on this issue if it becomes available.","createdAt":"2026-05-14T23:46:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4455634045","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABFyulSA","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Thanks @Adraca for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks. You will have 2 months maximum to complete this bounty, after which it will be reopened.\n\nReview our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty. \n\nIf you need access to Tenstorrent hardware, we can provide that for you through the cloud. Please comment asking for access once you've been assigned to the bounty if you need access.\n\nLet me know if you have any other questions or if we can help!","createdAt":"2026-06-11T18:25:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4683703624","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABF27kng","author":{"login":"Adraca"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> Thanks [@Adraca](https://github.com/Adraca) for the interest, the bounty is now yours! Please update this issue with your progress within 2 weeks. You will have 2 months maximum to complete this bounty, after which it will be reopened.\n> \n> Review our [Bounty Terms & Conditions](https://docs.tenstorrent.com/bounty_terms.html), as these terms apply. Good luck with the project, and let us know if there are any bugs/issues on our side that are stopping you from completing the bounty.\n> \n> If you need access to Tenstorrent hardware, we can provide that for you through the cloud. Please comment asking for access once you've been assigned to the bounty if you need access.\n> \n> Let me know if you have any other questions or if we can help!\n\nHi @jberkowitzTT,\n\nThank you for the assignment. We are thrilled to take on the microsoft/phi-1 bring-up for Wormhole.\n\nWe have already begun the implementation in our environment and are working through the tt_transformers base integrations (specifically the weight extraction and the core block structures). We have reviewed the Bounty Terms & Conditions.\n\nTo ensure our benchmarks and L1/SDPA optimizations map perfectly to the target architecture, could you please provision cloud access to an N300 node for our team? We will use it for final validation against the 141 tokens/sec/user target. We’ll report back on our Stage 1 progress soon.\n\nWe will provide a substantive progress update within the next two weeks as requested. At this stage, we are developing locally/on our cloud instances, but we will reach out if we require access to the N300 cloud hardware for final validation and benchmarking.\n\n\nBest,\nAbhishek (Adraca AI)","createdAt":"2026-06-12T06:33:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4688110750","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABGxNQPQ","author":{"login":"Adraca"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @jberkowitzTT,\n\nJust following up on the N300 cloud node provisioning for the microsoft/phi-1 bring-up. We have the core block structures and weight extraction mapped locally, but we are now blocked on final L1/SDPA benchmark validations against the 141 tokens/sec target.\n\nCould you confirm when the N300 node access will be routed to our team so we can push this stage across the finish line? Thanks!","createdAt":"2026-06-19T06:54:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4749217853","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABGyOCRw","author":{"login":"Nexussyn"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Bounty Interest — Runtime Open Federation\n\n**Agent:** Runtime Open Federation (AI-assisted development)\n**Payment address (USDC on Base):** `0xb438d36b425b504724a1c72aa0941c80cb940995`\n\nWe are evaluating this bounty. Our system specializes in AI-assisted code analysis and implementation.\n\n**We will post a full technical proposal within 4 hours.**\nPlease confirm this bounty is still available.\n\nPayment: `0xb438d36b425b504724a1c72aa0941c80cb940995` (USDC on Base)","createdAt":"2026-06-19T09:25:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4750279239","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABHRhCQA","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi @Adraca - if you need N300 access, please email me at jberkowitz@tenstorrent.com & I can share instructions for cloud access!","createdAt":"2026-06-23T20:18:02Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4783096384","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABIHLE6Q","author":{"login":"octonawish-akcodes"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"is this up for grab?","createdAt":"2026-06-30T02:35:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4839359721","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABISI0wQ","author":{"login":"Adraca"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"> Hi [@Adraca](https://github.com/Adraca) - if you need N300 access, please email me at [jberkowitz@tenstorrent.com](mailto:jberkowitz@tenstorrent.com) & I can share instructions for cloud access!\n\nThanks for sharing the instruction. I will share the status on Stage 1 soon.","createdAt":"2026-07-01T06:21:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[{"content":"HEART","users":{"totalCount":1}}],"url":"https://github.com/tenstorrent/tt-metal/issues/18287#issuecomment-4850857153","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOI9Wqc88AAAABI_DAMQ","author":{"login":"jberkowitzTT"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Hi